{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discarded</strong> is a brutal roguelike arena shooter where survival means adapting fast \u2014 and killing faster. You're an out-of-work ex-soldier who's good at only one thing \u2014 and it's time to cash in. Face wave after wave of relentless enemies, upgrade your build, and fight for profit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No mercy. No excuses. Just you, your weapon, and your will to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/3cc0d3b618fd9da946ae624ab4f561fc.avif?t=1768862318\" width=607 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/671df3c9a663cef5154aaf35ed11b80d.poster.avif?t=1768862318\" width=606 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/671df3c9a663cef5154aaf35ed11b80d.webm?t=1768862318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/671df3c9a663cef5154aaf35ed11b80d.mp4?t=1768862318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Discarded</strong>, you\u2019ll face a wide variety of enemies \u2014 from petty thieves and hired mercenaries, to aliens and decommissioned military robots. To spice things up, the arena management will throw in deadly hazards like high explosives, spike traps, landmines, poisonous gas, and much more \u2014 all to keep the crowd entertained. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try not to trip over a landmine \u2014 the janitors are getting tired of mopping up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/196cae519a44497b612e94ceaa6e42d7.avif?t=1768862318\" width=607 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/88042171a2bb97813c88fc037834d4c9.webp?t=1768862318\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/88042171a2bb97813c88fc037834d4c9.poster.avif?t=1768862318\" class=\"bb_img\" width=607 height=341 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to look like you know what you're doing? Take a pistol. Need to compensate for aim with bullets? Grab an SMG. Got patience and a god complex? Sniper\u2019s for you. Or maybe you just want to make things disappear \u2014 in that case, say hello to the grenade launcher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/1c9f64c2b04ff19408cb49d918446c67.avif?t=1768862318\" width=607 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/fadeee579a921eb727b1e52873f68a71.poster.avif?t=1768862318\" width=606 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/fadeee579a921eb727b1e52873f68a71.webm?t=1768862318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/fadeee579a921eb727b1e52873f68a71.mp4?t=1768862318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Better think twice about your choices \u2014 every upgrade comes with a downside. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sure, +50% damage sounds great\u2026 until you realize a mosquito can one-shot you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yeah, you built a glass cannon. Good luck with that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/3f0e7740b2e4476ec2ee548ca32fa381.avif?t=1768862318\" width=607 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/04aea37ea1fc0996a6a1ca52fef762cd.poster.avif?t=1768862318\" width=606 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/04aea37ea1fc0996a6a1ca52fef762cd.webm?t=1768862318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/04aea37ea1fc0996a6a1ca52fef762cd.mp4?t=1768862318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab whatever gun fits your style \u2014 just remember, hauling a high-caliber monster turns you into a walking turret\u2026 minus the armor. Enemies will see you coming from a mile away, and trust me \u2014 they\u2019ll be ready. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But hey, at least you\u2019ll look cool while getting shredded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of unique enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources and create unique builds every run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple weapon types to suit your playstyle</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3921920?t=1768862318","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3921920?t=1768862318","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/7d93c41f0052cf7c560931e4a25dad71727dae76/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768862318","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/7d93c41f0052cf7c560931e4a25dad71727dae76/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768862318","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discarded</strong> is a brutal roguelike arena shooter where survival means adapting fast \u2014 and killing faster. You're an out-of-work ex-soldier who's good at only one thing \u2014 and it's time to cash in. Face wave after wave of relentless enemies, upgrade your build, and fight for profit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No mercy. No excuses. Just you, your weapon, and your will to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/3cc0d3b618fd9da946ae624ab4f561fc.avif?t=1768862318\" width=607 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/671df3c9a663cef5154aaf35ed11b80d.poster.avif?t=1768862318\" width=606 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/671df3c9a663cef5154aaf35ed11b80d.webm?t=1768862318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/671df3c9a663cef5154aaf35ed11b80d.mp4?t=1768862318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Discarded</strong>, you\u2019ll face a wide variety of enemies \u2014 from petty thieves and hired mercenaries, to aliens and decommissioned military robots. To spice things up, the arena management will throw in deadly hazards like high explosives, spike traps, landmines, poisonous gas, and much more \u2014 all to keep the crowd entertained. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try not to trip over a landmine \u2014 the janitors are getting tired of mopping up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/196cae519a44497b612e94ceaa6e42d7.avif?t=1768862318\" width=607 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/88042171a2bb97813c88fc037834d4c9.webp?t=1768862318\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/88042171a2bb97813c88fc037834d4c9.poster.avif?t=1768862318\" class=\"bb_img\" width=607 height=341 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to look like you know what you're doing? Take a pistol. Need to compensate for aim with bullets? Grab an SMG. Got patience and a god complex? Sniper\u2019s for you. Or maybe you just want to make things disappear \u2014 in that case, say hello to the grenade launcher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/1c9f64c2b04ff19408cb49d918446c67.avif?t=1768862318\" width=607 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/fadeee579a921eb727b1e52873f68a71.poster.avif?t=1768862318\" width=606 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/fadeee579a921eb727b1e52873f68a71.webm?t=1768862318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/fadeee579a921eb727b1e52873f68a71.mp4?t=1768862318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Better think twice about your choices \u2014 every upgrade comes with a downside. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sure, +50% damage sounds great\u2026 until you realize a mosquito can one-shot you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yeah, you built a glass cannon. Good luck with that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/3f0e7740b2e4476ec2ee548ca32fa381.avif?t=1768862318\" width=607 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/04aea37ea1fc0996a6a1ca52fef762cd.poster.avif?t=1768862318\" width=606 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/04aea37ea1fc0996a6a1ca52fef762cd.webm?t=1768862318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/04aea37ea1fc0996a6a1ca52fef762cd.mp4?t=1768862318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab whatever gun fits your style \u2014 just remember, hauling a high-caliber monster turns you into a walking turret\u2026 minus the armor. Enemies will see you coming from a mile away, and trust me \u2014 they\u2019ll be ready. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But hey, at least you\u2019ll look cool while getting shredded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of unique enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources and create unique builds every run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple weapon types to suit your playstyle</p></li></ul>","developers":["GitBit Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/57882318f10e9c15a42cd0cdb557f8f34e737f23/header.jpg?t=1768862318","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3921920/1766982727/2798bdfea681052fb33824cb9726cb7bde10fc9a/1760214220/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760789475","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3921920/1766982727/2798bdfea681052fb33824cb9726cb7bde10fc9a/1760214220/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760789475","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3921920/1766982727/2798bdfea681052fb33824cb9726cb7bde10fc9a/1760214220/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760789475","id":257215703,"name":"Discarded_trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257215703/46991484ce037f2839af48a1512e63f7ff9f1e6f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760789475"}],"name":"Discarded","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel core I3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 960, Radeon R9 380<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 512 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":